  was set, so `this.emit(...)` (which reads the instance field
  `this.TAG` from the base class) produced malformed event names like
  `:remove` instead of `image-input:remove`, and consumer listeners
  never fired. Added `TAG = ImageInput.TAG` as an instance field. See
  Codebase Patterns above.
